### 음성 채널 참여
POST {{baseUrl}}/voice/channels/{{channelId}}/join
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 음성 채널 나가기
POST {{baseUrl}}/voice/channels/{{channelId}}/leave
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 음성 채널 참여자 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/voice/channels/{{channelId}}/participants
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 음성 세션 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/voice/sessions/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### LiveKit 웹훅 수신
POST {{baseUrl}}/voice/webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{}
